,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL),(10196,2015,10061,'النيازك','06','02','01',NULL,'This project talks about the nayzak when it reaches the Earth and at what time also it explains the damages it forms on the planet , we work as pairs to find some solutions about how we protect the Earth  from its damage  and we disscuss the time .  ','It aims to solve the problem when it hits the Earth and it also talks about to put some rules to save the Earth. ','cardboards , Earth , wood , laser,\r\nthe information\'s from the internet ','first one:search about the nayzak\r\nsecond: plan \r\nthird: bring the materials\r\nfourth: working with the materials\r\nfifth : solutions\r\n','النيازك.jpg',327,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL),(10197,2015,10061,'بيئتنا','03','01','02',NULL,'this project talks about the water that comes from the houses how we should protect it and make it unpolluted e design a project we makes underground tubes that water comes through then we we send them to a place where we filtrate this water and  .  ','It aims  to protect the water and make it unpolluted.\r\nthe problem is water.\r\n','we use a wood ,pipes , plastic houses , filter s','study the problem\r\nmakes research about  the problem\r\nstart to work with materials\r\nthink about solution\r\nsuggest more  solutions\r\n','Water pollution.docx',328,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL),(10198,2016,10061,'المنضومه الشمسيه','06','01','01',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,424,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL),(10199,2015,10062,'جهاز إنذار للإختناق','01','02','02',NULL,'المشروع هو  عبارة عن آلة أوتوماتكية تقوم بقياس نسبة الأوكسجين في الغرفة وفي حال وجد النسبة متدنية ما يشكل خطر على الأشخاص الموجودين تقوم بإعطاء إنذار صوتي وأمر للمدفئة بإطفائها.                       ..................................................','هناك العديد من حالات الإختناق في المنازل بسبب المدفئة ما يوجب تواجد آلة إنذار تحمي الإن